# ─── DATA — NONE COMMITTED ───────────────────────────────────────
# This is the public, code-only release. Per the ethics approval, NO
# individual-level data of any kind is included (not even the
# de-identified cleaned.csv). These rules stop patient or source data
# being added by accident.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.parquet
*.feather
*.sav
*.dta
*.rds
*.sas7bdat
source_file_bronze.csv
